{
  "sn24.71:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 24.71 ",
  "sn24.71:0.2": "4. Catutthagamanavagga ",
  "sn24.71:0.3": "Navātasutta ",
  "sn24.71:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn24.71:1.2": "“Kismiṁ nu kho, bhikkhave, sati kiṁ upādāya, kiṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
  "sn24.71:1.3": "‘na vātā vāyanti, na najjo sandanti, na gabbhiniyo vijāyanti, na candimasūriyā udenti vā apenti vā esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhitā’”ti? ",
  "sn24.71:1.4": "“Bhagavaṁmūlakā no, bhante, dhammā …pe…. ",
  "sn24.71:2.1": "“Rūpe kho, bhikkhave, sati, rūpaṁ upādāya, rūpaṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
  "sn24.71:2.2": "‘na vātā vāyanti …pe… esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhitā’ti. ",
  "sn24.71:2.3": "Vedanāya sati …pe… ",
  "sn24.71:2.4": "saññāya sati … ",
  "sn24.71:2.5": "saṅkhāresu sati … ",
  "sn24.71:2.6": "viññāṇe sati, viññāṇaṁ upādāya, viññāṇaṁ abhinivissa evaṁ diṭṭhi uppajjati: ",
  "sn24.71:2.7": "‘na vātā vāyanti …pe… esikaṭṭhāyiṭṭhitā’”ti. ",
  "sn24.71:2.8": "“Taṁ kiṁ maññatha, bhikkhave, ",
  "sn24.71:2.9": "rūpaṁ niccaṁ vā aniccaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn24.71:2.10": "“Aniccaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn24.71:2.11": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vā taṁ sukhaṁ vā”ti? ",
  "sn24.71:2.12": "“Dukkhaṁ, bhante”. ",
  "sn24.71:2.13": "“Yaṁ panāniccaṁ dukkhaṁ vipariṇāmadhammaṁ, kallaṁ nu taṁ samanupassituṁ: ",
  "sn24.71:2.14": "‘etaṁ mama, esoham